  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre Triax is the world's first Hybrid Multifilament string, combining polyester, polyamide and polyurethane into a single construction. It offers the comfort and power of a premium multifilament while delivering the control, spin and durability typically associated with polyester strings, making it one of the most balanced strings in the Tecnifibre lineup.",
    "zh": "Tecnifibre Triax 是全球首款 Hybrid Multifilament（混合多芯）球线，将聚酯、聚酰胺与聚氨酯三种材料融合于同一结构中。它兼具传统多芯线的舒适性和力量输出，同时拥有接近聚酯线的控制、旋转和耐久表现，是 Tecnifibre 产品线中最均衡、最全面的高性能球线之一。"
